					<meta name="Description" content="Fight, mine, and build your squadron in a 3D space-combat roguelike where your wingmen fight at your command. Dogfight pirates &amp;amp; aliens, mine asteroids to fund your arsenal and grow a squadron of up to 16 ships. Defeat colossal bosses, survive in Endless. Play solo or in two-player co-op.">
			
