								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>You fly the fighter. Your squadron flies with you.</strong></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Void Squadron is a fast 3D space-combat roguelite. Dogfight pirate fleets, drill asteroids for ore and turn every wave's haul into weapons, upgrades and wingmen. Fifteen waves and three colossal bosses stand between you and the heart of the Void.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/1abbfb384a3bd3c88b7b4b2201da3e92.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/1abbfb384a3bd3c88b7b4b2201da3e92.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/1abbfb384a3bd3c88b7b4b2201da3e92.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >FIGHT</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Boost, strafe and barrel-roll through the crossfire in full 3D. Pirate raiders, snipers, bombers, leeches, mine-layers and shield tenders each fight their own way, and alien fleets bring scouts, destroyers and motherships.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >MINE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/5c283449e09a92f35462ffcbcb357dcf.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/5c283449e09a92f35462ffcbcb357dcf.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/5c283449e09a92f35462ffcbcb357dcf.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Asteroids hold iron and rare minerals, and every armory rank costs ore. Drill deposits yourself under fire, or let your mining wing work the field while you keep the raiders off them.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >UPGRADE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/6678f0f86f1d58107dc73a02f861a272.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/6678f0f86f1d58107dc73a02f861a272.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/6678f0f86f1d58107dc73a02f861a272.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Refit between waves with upgrades from a pool of 62, then rank 12 armory systems up to rank 5: the hull-piercing Lance of Dawn, the Auto Gatling, a Gravity Bomb that drags enemies into a singularity, the Starbreaker nova, the Thunder Ram, an Aegis Field, a Ghost Veil cloak and more.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/34909f69b4d08e0fd4f5856ec7ed608e.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/34909f69b4d08e0fd4f5856ec7ed608e.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/34909f69b4d08e0fd4f5856ec7ed608e.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Pair a system with the right upgrade and it evolves: Lance of Dawn becomes Dawnbreaker, Starbreaker becomes Supernova, the Gravity Bomb becomes Event Horizon. Eight evolutions in all.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/4d256644aab9ec5fdb793a12d66d55bd.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/4d256644aab9ec5fdb793a12d66d55bd.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/4d256644aab9ec5fdb793a12d66d55bd.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >RECRUIT. COMMAND THE WING.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/2706ef29f52251bb5d47b89f2c3c2cc7.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/2706ef29f52251bb5d47b89f2c3c2cc7.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/2706ef29f52251bb5d47b89f2c3c2cc7.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Hire from 12 ship types across three roles (miners, protectors and attackers), including rare two-slot freighters, frigates and gunships. Grow your fleet from 6 to 16 slots, then lead it. Focus their fire on your target, form them up around you, or let them hunt. When a wing's ability is charged, call it in: an Attack Run on your target, a Barrier that soaks incoming fire, or an Ore Surge that cracks every deposit in range at once.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/9b1720a3ba29bb3f30c98e40270f7c2d.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/9b1720a3ba29bb3f30c98e40270f7c2d.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/9b1720a3ba29bb3f30c98e40270f7c2d.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >THREE SECTORS. THREE BOSSES.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/a302fc698863bc87990767be70952c9d.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/a302fc698863bc87990767be70952c9d.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/a302fc698863bc87990767be70952c9d.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Push from the Pirate Frontier through the green Hive Expanse into the purple Void, five waves at a time, through minefields, spore clouds and gravity wells. Each sector ends in a boss fight. Tear the turrets off the Pirate Dreadnought, burst the Hive Carrier's brood sacs, and boost out of the Void Leviathan's gravity snare before its beam fires.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/e8759796e9da2312b51632a61fe705ee.poster.avif?t=1793138467" width=780 height=438 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/e8759796e9da2312b51632a61fe705ee.webm?t=1793138467" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5320150/extras/e8759796e9da2312b51632a61fe705ee.mp4?t=1793138467" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Beat all three and the run keeps going: Endless mode changes sector every wave.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >EVERY RUN PUSHES FURTHER</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Take optional contracts for bonus credits: bring every ally home, mine every deposit, clear the wave inside 90 seconds. Earn Salvage to unlock new starting loadouts, crews, a fourth upgrade offer and Heat modifiers. Play on Relaxed, Normal or Veteran.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >BRING A WINGMATE</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Invite a friend into two-player online co-op and fight through the sectors together.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >FEATURES</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Full 3D space combat with boost, strafe and barrel rolls, built for mouse and keyboard</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Three sectors, 15 waves and three boss fights, then Endless</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >62 upgrades, 8 evolutions and 12 armory systems with five ranks each</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >12 wingman ships across Mine, Protect and Attack roles, in fleets of up to 16 slots</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Wing commands and charged squadron abilities</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Optional contracts, Salvage unlocks, Heat modifiers and three difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Two-player online co-op</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >A 50-track soundtrack with combat music for every sector and a theme for every boss</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Nine hull paints and six engine colours, all included</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >15 Steam achievements and Steam Cloud saves</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>How far can your squadron go?</strong></p>						</div>
					</div>
